            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 147
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 1024
            },
            "total_tokens": 2178,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P07-S02-U09",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "那套餐具现在被我收到柜子里了，看不见反而轻松一点。可每次经过玄关，还是觉得少了什么东西，像有个没点发送的消息悬在头顶。",
      "request_sha256": "3ff2b26124c88cb7c9c3186f554acb2b60be903451b55b8030f310eee5b32130",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 2690,
